      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_7",
      "quote": "Only studies published from 2015 onward were considered; this date threshold was determined to focus on evidence generated after widespread adoption of the PSS-10 as the dominant instrument in metabolic research",
      "reason": "Publication year restriction is specified with rationale, but no language or publication status criteria are reported."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
