      "chunk_id": "text_9",
      "quote": "reported MetS diagnosis or at least one metabolic component; and (5) provided sufficient data to derive effect estimates",
      "reason": "The criteria mention sufficient data for effect estimates but do not distinguish exclusion because outcomes were not measured from exclusion because results were not reported."
    },
